ory_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Vz2RN55rTJBGn43K1v84nA","review_id":"ZPXrv9lHdb_aORfioYVrYg","date":"2015-07-09T14:51:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9514359831809998,"text_excerpt":"Guess I need to add to the ever growing list or reviews praising Domenica! Located inside the Roosevelt Hotel the place is super fancy but laid back at the same time if that makes any sense. The atmosphere, guests, and even the servers were way more chill than I was expecting. Which was a good thing. IDK why but pizza and wine surely reminds me of having a moving party or a relaxing girls night in. Needless to say we thoroughly enjoyed ourselves as such. Visited for Happy Hour during Essence Music Festival weekend with some girlfriends of mine. We ordered the Calabrese and \"All-Meats\" pizza, wine and beer. The pizza was amazing. The crust is definitely the best part. Its not to filling bu..."},{"business_id":"Vz2RN55rTJBGn43K1v84nA","review_id":"D8ObGbW76CXWcZ7QqnTk2g","date":"2017-07-23T18:39:46","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.94792640209198,"text_excerpt":"If you get tired on New Orleans cuisine, try Domenica for some great Italian flare. Food was delicious. Some of the best pasta we've ever had! We had a fresh, homemade inventive dish that was delectable. Thin pasta with shredded rabbit. Yum! We also wanted good pizza and had passed by here previously. This is an upscale-ish restaurant. You don't have to be in your best clothes, but probably not a tank top and baseball hat. I highly recommend the smoked pork or margherita pizza. Both are wonderful! Service was attentive and efficient. Location is convenient and very clean!"},{"business_id":"Vz2RN55rTJBGn43K1v84nA","review_id":"mMWIuIBNWCBDyEHfojE1Ag","date":"2013-04-02T02:40:24","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9457398653030396,"text_excerpt":"Though we missed the happy hour, our dinner at Domenica was one of the better ones of our trip. In fact, the best thing I ate in New Orleans was probably the whipped feta goat cheese served with roasted cauliflower; if you are goat cheese fan like I am, it is a must try. Also, I am a huge bellini fan, and they are an uncommon menu item where I am from, so I loved that their drink specials included three different types of \"bellinis\" (though I stuck with peach). I made reservations for Friday night and that seemed like a wise decision based on how full the restaurant was. We found our waiter pleasantly charming, and our entire meal was tasty. 5 stars because I can think of nothing that was..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Vz2RN55rTJBGn43K1v84nA","photo_id":"elflVEK3sCzFb5mH_bUfxA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/elflVEK3sCzFb5mH_bUfxA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8683931827545166},{"business_id":"Vz2RN55rTJBGn43K1v84nA","photo_id":"FzhpBGTtGGKZ5OhWyIw0lw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/FzhpBGTtGGKZ5OhWyIw0lw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8630974888801575},{"business_id":"Vz2RN55rTJBGn43K1v84nA","photo_id":"PvUTLZs4ADSlA62pepe_Yw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/PvUTLZs4ADSlA62pepe_Yw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8589479923248291},{"business_id":"Vz2RN55rTJBGn43K1v84nA","photo_id":"9QxPcimW7-v1TM0merw8yA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/9QxPcimW7-v1TM0merw8yA.jpg","visual_represen